Subject: [PATCH 16/24] =?UTF-8?q?fix(doze):=20SystemUI=20=E6=89=93?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=BC=80=20doze=5Fdisplay=5Fstate=5Fsupported=EF=BC=88batch27?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EF=BC=89?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

AOSP 默认 false，DozeParameters 因此认为面板不支持 DOZE 态，
AOD 时直接请求 Display.STATE_OFF（黑屏）。实测 batch26:
mWakefulness=Dozing 但 display powerMode=Off。补上后才会请求 STATE_DOZE。
---
 .../base/packages/SystemUI/res/values/config.xml         | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 overlay/frameworks/base/packages/SystemUI/res/values/config.xml

diff --git a/overlay/frameworks/base/packages/SystemUI/res/values/config.xml b/overlay/frameworks/base/packages/SystemUI/res/values/config.xml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..40a15f7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/overlay/frameworks/base/packages/SystemUI/res/values/config.xml
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
+<resources>
+    <!--
+      Phase 2A 补充：SystemUI 的 DozeParameters 用这个开关决定 AOD 时是否
+      请求 Display.STATE_DOZE。AOSP 默认 false，会让面板直接 OFF（AOD 黑屏）。
+      补成 true 后 DozeMachine 才会在 DOZE_AOD 状态下请求 DOZE。
+    -->
+    <bool name="doze_display_state_supported">true</bool>
+</resources>
